# Cybercultural

> {{ meta.siteDescription | safe }} Written by {{ meta.author.name | safe }}, who founded and edited ReadWriteWeb from 2003 to 2012. The site covers the internet from the pre-web era through the dot-com years, Web 2.0 and after, in {{ allPosts | length }} articles.

Every article is also published as plain markdown at its own URL plus `index.md` — for example {{ site }}{{ allPosts[0].url }}index.md. This file is generated from the site's content at each build, so it does not go stale.

